␀␀␀␀HTTP OTA authentication failed␀␀HTTP OTA started: %s␀␀␀␀HTTP OTA wrote %u bytes␀auth␀␀␀␀receive␀ArduinoOTA error %u␀ArduinoOTA error %u (%s) after %u%%: %s␀Update failed - still on v0.4.167␀␀␀update available␀␀␀␀current␀Release channel changed␀GitHub latest v%s (%s)␀␀<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=utf-8><meta name=viewport content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>MakerMonitor</title><style>:root{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#090c10;--panel:#121821;--line:#253142;--muted:#8d9bab;--ink:#f3f6fa;--accent:#36d17c;--blue:#55a6ff;--danger:#ff6b6b}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 0,#142237 0,var(--bg) 42%);color:var(--ink);font:15px system-ui,sans-serif}main{width:min(1100px,calc(100% - 28px));margin:auto;padding:26px 0 50px}header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;margin-bottom:24px}.brand{font-size:23px;font-weight:800}.brand i{color:var(--accent);font-style:normal}.online{color:var(--accent);font-size:13px}.tabs{display:flex;gap:5px;overflow:auto;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:18px}.tabs button{border:0;background:none;color:var(--muted);padding:12px 15px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer}.tabs button.on{color:var(--ink);border-bottom:2px solid var(--accent)}.tab{display:none}.tab.on{display:block}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr);gap:14px}.card{grid-column:span 6;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--panel) 94%,transparent);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px}.wide{grid-column:span 12}.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}.metric{padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:#0c121a}.metric b{display:block;font-size:22px;margin-top:5px}h2{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 15px}p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #202a37}.row:last-child{border:0}.label small{display:block;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}select,input{background:#090f16;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid #314156;border-radius:8px;padding:9px;max-width:210px}button,.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--accent);color:#041209;border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:10px 14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer}.secondary{background:#223044;color:var(--ink)}.danger{background:var(--danger);color:#1a0505}.actions{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:14px}.version{font-size:31px;font-weight:800}.tag{display:inline-block;color:var(--blue);background:#14253a;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px}progress{width:100%;accent-color:var(--accent)}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;max-height:280px;overflow:auto;color:#afbdcb;background:#080c11;padding:13px;border-radius:9px;font:12px ui-monospace,monospace}.warn{border:1px solid var(--warn);color:var(--warn);background:#2a1f05;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 14px;margin:-8px 0 18px}.warn a{color:var(--warn)}.pw{display:flex;gap:8px}.pw input{flex:1;max-width:none}.spin{display:inline-block;width:14px;height:14px;border:2px solid var(--muted);border-top-color:var(--accent);border-radius:50%;animation:sp 1s linear infinite;vertical-align:-2px;margin-right:8px}@keyframes sp{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}@media(max-width:720px){main{width:min(100% - 18px,1100px);padding-top:16px}header{align-items:flex-start}.card{grid-column:span 12}.metrics{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.row{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}select,input{max-width:100%;width:100%}}</style></head><body><main><header><div><div class=brand>Maker<i>Monitor</i></div><div style='color:var(--muted)'>␀␀</div></div><div class=online>в—Џ ␀␀Offline␀</div></header>␀<nav class=tabs><button class=on data-tab=status>Status</button><button data-tab=firmware>Firmware</button><button data-tab=display>Settings</button><button data-tab=network>Network</button></nav><section id=status class='tab on'><div class=grid><div class='card wide'><h2>Today</h2><div class=metrics>␀␀<div class=warn>вљ  No console password: anyone on this network can change settings or install firmware. <a href=#network onclick="document.querySelector('[data-tab=network]').click()">Set one</a></div>␀␀<div class=metric><span>␀␀␀␀</b></div>␀␀</div></div><div class=card><h2>Account</h2><div class=row><span>MakerWorld</span><b>␀␀␀Waiting for data␀␀␀␀</b></div><div class=row><span>Followers</span><b>␀␀</b></div><div class=row><span>Models</span><b>␀</b></div><div class=actions><button onclick=post('/poll-now')>Poll now</button><a class='btn secondary' href='https://makerworld.com/en/@Wofl' target=_blank>Open profile</a></div></div><div class=card><h2>Device</h2><div class=row><span>Firmware</span><b>v0.4.167</b></div><div class=row><span>Board</span><b>jc4880p443</b></div><div class=row><span>IP address</span><b>␀</b></div><div class=row><span>Hostname</span><b>␀␀␀.local</b></div><div class=row><span>Signal</span><b>␀␀␀ dBm␀␀␀␀вЂ”␀</b></div><div class=row><span>Uptime</span><b>␀ h</b></div><div class=row><span>Last restart</span><b>␀</b></div><div class=row><span>Internal RAM free / lowest</span><b>␀ / ␀ KB␀</b></div><div class=row><span>PSRAM free</span><b>␀</b></div><div class=row><span>Firmware installed</span><b>␀</b></div><div class=actions><a class='btn secondary' href=/screenshot.png target=_blank>Screenshot</a><a class='btn secondary' href=/diagnostics target=_blank>Diagnostics JSON</a></div></div><div class='card wide'><h2>Recent device log</h2><pre id=logs>␀␀</pre><div class=actions><button class=secondary onclick=loadLogs()>Refresh log</button><button class=secondary onclick=clearLogs()>Clear log</button></div></div></div></section><section id=firmware class=tab><div class=grid><div class=card><span class=tag>INSTALLED</span><p class=version>v0.4.167</p><p>This device is running the firmware-jc4880p443.bin build, installed ␀␀␀.</p></div><div class=card><span class=tag>GITHUB RELEASE</span><p class=version id=latest>␀Not checked␀</p><p id=updateState>␀␀A newer compatible release is ready.␀␀␀␀</p><progress id=prog max=100 value=0></progress><div class=actions><button onclick=githubUpdate('check')>Check now</button><button onclick=githubUpdate('install')>Install update</button></div></div><div class='card wide'><h2>Install local firmware</h2><p>Use a local <code>firmware.bin</code> when testing or when no GitHub release is available.</p><form id=upf method=post action=/update enctype=multipart/form-data><input type=file name=firmware accept=.bin required> <button>Upload &amp; install</button></form><progress id=upprog max=100 value=0 style=display:none></progress><p id=upstate></p></div></div></section><section id=display class=tab><form action=/save method=post><div class=grid>␀␀This device is up to date.␀␀Check GitHub for the newest compatible board build.␀<div class=card><h2>Display</h2>␀␀␀␀Turns the picture and touch around if the panel is mounted upside down.␀</div><div class=card><h2>Quiet hours</h2><label class=row><span class=label>Quiet hours<small>No banners or chimes; the screen sleeps once idle. May cross midnight.</small></span><input type=hidden name=quiet_form value=1><input type=checkbox name=quieton value=1␀␀␀␀ checked␀␀␀␀Once idle in quiet hours␀␀␀␀During quiet hours␀␀Quiet from␀␀Quiet until␀</div><div class=card><h2>Alerts</h2>␀␀␀Banner and chime for these events␀␀␀</div><div class=card><h2>Network</h2>␀␀The poller picks this up within 15 s␀␀␀␀</div><div class='card wide'><button>Save settings</button></div></div></form></section><section id=network class=tab><div class=grid><div class=card><h2>Wi-Fi</h2><div class=row><span>Network</span><b>␀␀</b></div><div class=row><span>Address</span><b>␀␀␀␀.local</b></div><form action=/save-host method=post><label class=row><span class=label>Custom hostname<small>Blank keeps the MAC name. Lowercase letters, digits and '-'. Applies right away.</small></span><input name=hostname maxlength=32 placeholder='makermonitor' value='␀␀␀␀'></label><label class=row><span class=label>Announce on the network (mDNS)</span><input type=hidden name=mdns_form value=1><input type=checkbox name=mdns value=1␀␀></label><div class=actions><button>Save hostname</button><button name=clear value=1 class=secondary>Use default</button></div></form><div class=actions><button onclick="post('/wifi-setup')">Start Wi-Fi setup</button><button class=danger onclick="post('/reset-wifi',true)">Reset Wi-Fi</button></div></div><div class=card><h2>Console security</h2><p>Leave blank for local-network access without a password. Set a password to protect this console and OTA uploads (username: <b>admin</b>).</p><form action=/save-password method=post><div class=pw><input type=password id=pw name=password maxlength=47 placeholder='New password' autocomplete=new-password><button type=button class=secondary onclick="let i=qs('#pw');i.type=i.type=='password'?'text':'password';this.textContent=i.type=='password'?'Show':'Hide'">Show</button></div><div class=actions><button>Save password</button><button name=clear value=1 class=secondary>Clear password</button></div></form></div><div class='card wide'><h2>GitHub update preferences</h2><form action=/save-ota method=post><label class=row><span class=label>Automatic checks<small>Check hourly while online</small></span><input type=checkbox name=auto value=1␀␀␀␀></label><label class=row><span class=label>Beta releases<small>Include prerelease firmware</small></span><input type=checkbox name=beta value=1␀␀␀␀></label><div class=actions><button>Save update preferences</button></div></form></div></div></section><script>const qs=s=>document.querySelector(s);document.querySelectorAll('.tabs button').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{document.querySelectorAll('.tabs button,.tab').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('on'));b.classList.add('on');qs('#'+b.dataset.tab).classList.add('on');history.replaceState(0,'','#'+b.dataset.tab)});let h=location.hash.slice(1),tb=h&&document.querySelector(`[data-tab="${h}"]`);if(tb)tb.click();async function post(u,confirmIt){if(confirmIt&&!confirm('Reset saved Wi-Fi and reboot?'))return;let r=await fetch(u,{method:'POST'});alert(await r.text());if(r.ok&&u=='/reset-wifi')location.reload()}async function githubUpdate(a){let b=qs('#updateState'),pr=qs('#prog');b.textContent=a=='check'?'CheckingвЂ¦':'Starting updateвЂ¦';let r=await fetch('/github-update?action='+a,{method:'POST'});let j=await r.json();while(j.checking){await new Promise(z=>setTimeout(z,1000));r=await fetch('/github-update?action=status',{method:'POST'});j=await r.json()}b.textContent=j.message||'Request failed';if(j.version)qs('#latest').textContent='v'+j.version;if(j.progress)pr.value=j.progress;if(j.reboot)waitBack(b)}function waitBack(el){el.innerHTML='<span class=spin></span>Restarting - this page reloads when the panel is back';setTimeout(function t(){fetch('/ping',{cache:'no-store'}).then(r=>r.ok?location.reload():setTimeout(t,2000)).catch(()=>setTimeout(t,2000))},5000)}qs('#upf').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();let f=qs('#upf'),pr=qs('#upprog'),st=qs('#upstate'),x=new XMLHttpRequest();pr.style.display='block';st.textContent='Uploading...';x.upload.onprogress=v=>{if(v.lengthComputable){pr.value=v.loaded*100/v.total;st.textContent='Uploading '+Math.round(v.loaded*100/v.total)+'%'}};x.onload=()=>{if(x.status==200)waitBack(st);else st.textContent='Update failed: '+x.responseText};x.onerror=()=>waitBack(st);x.open('POST','/update');x.send(new FormData(f))};async function loadLogs(){qs('#logs').textContent=await(await fetch('/diagnostics/logs')).text()}async function clearLogs(){await fetch('/diagnostics/logs',{method:'DELETE'});loadLogs()}</script></main></body></html>␀␀␀text/html; charset=utf-8␀␀␀␀<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset=utf-8><meta name=viewport content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>MakerMonitor Wi-Fi</title><style>body{font:16px system-ui,sans-serif;background:#06090e;color:#e6edf3;margin:0;padding:20px}input,select,button{font:inherit;width:100%;padding:10px;margin:6px 0 14px;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #1e2a38;background:#121a25;color:#e6edf3}button{background:#22d3ee;color:#06090e;border:0;font-weight:600}#r{color:#22d3ee}</style></head><body><h2>Connect Guition 4.3 to Wi-Fi</h2><form id=f><label>Network</label><select name=pick onchange="document.getElementById('s').value=this.value"><option value=''>Choose...</option>␀<option>␀␀␀␀</select><label>or type its name</label><input id=s name=ssid maxlength=32 autocapitalize=none><label>Password</label><input name=pass type=password maxlength=64><button>Connect</button></form><p id=r></p><script>const r=document.getElementById('r');document.getElementById('f').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();r.textContent='Connecting...';await fetch('/ap-connect',{method:'POST',body:new URLSearchParams(new FormData(e.target))});const t=setInterval(async()=>{try{const j=await (await fetch('/ap-status')).json();r.textContent=j.msg;if(j.state>=2)clearInterval(t)}catch(x){r.textContent='Connected - the panel is switching networks.';clearInterval(t)}},1000)}</script></body></html>␀auto␀␀␀␀beta␀␀␀␀GitHub update preferences saved␀ghcheck␀GitHub check task failed to start; internal heap %u␀Update: boot switch failed (0x%x); restarting␀␀␀boot partition switch failed␀␀␀␀Update: boot partition is now %s␀␀␀␀ (mDNS off)␀hostname␀␀␀␀Use 1-23 letters, digits, or hyphens␀␀␀␀mdns_form␀␀␀mdns␀␀␀␀Now ␀␀␀␀bad state␀␀␀/state.json␀//''""\\bfn
